This dataset contains 5 additional files which are:\
\
Omicas_GP_phenotypes.csv is the phenotypic data acquired on 334 S0:4 families extracted from a synthetic population under two environmental conditions (LIM and ALU) following a p-rep design. Missing data are coded as NA\
\
Omicas_GP_BLUE.csv is the adjusted means (BLUEs), for the 334 S0:4 families, considering days to flower (FL), plant height (PH), grain yield (YLD) and grain zinc concentration (ZN)\
\
Omicas_GP_genotypes.txt is the genotypic data on the 334 S0 plants with 9928 SNP, after imputation. \
\
Omicas_GP_variables.csv is the list of traits recorded in the trials conducted in Aguazul, Colombia, during the main rice growing season in 2020\
\
Omicas_GP_germplasm.csv is the list of 334 families extracted form the recurrent population at the S0:4 generation including the temporal and local checks\
\
